title Stille Nacht (Silent Night)
composer Franz Xaver Gruber; arranged by Michael Stenov
about Michael Stenov's three-verse setting for choir, organ and orchestra.
tempo 84
beats 3
steps 4
swing 0
reverb 0.38

# Source: GL 249 Stille Nacht, Michael Stenov, IMSLP598736.
# https://imslp.org/wiki/Special:ReverseLookup/598736
# Arrangement and this adaptation: CC BY-SA 4.0.
# https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/
# Adaptation: Scrimshaw synthesis, wordless choir, all notes at concert pitch.
# The source has no metronome marking; quarter note = 84 is a playback choice.
# Every bar is 3/4: 12 sixteenth-note steps. All three verses play once.
# Published Violin 1/2, cello and contrabass parts double the choir throughout.

